urchase support.&nbsp; One of our specialists will locate&nbsp;your invoice and email it to you.For in-store transactions, please contact the store that performed the service.&nbsp; You can use our&nbsp;store locator&nbsp;if you’re having trouble finding their phone number.If you’re still unable to find your receipt, please call our consumer relations team at&nbsp;1-800-321-2136 - Mon – Fri 8:30 am – 5:00 pm EST."}},{"@type":"Question","name":" How many tire rebates can I submit?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"You are limited to one (1) reward per new set of up to ten (10) qualifying tires purchased in a single transaction."}},{"@type":"Question","name":" How to check the status of my Goodyear rebate?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"You can check the status of your previously submitted rebate online using the following link:&nbsp;https://www.goodyearrebates.com/existing"}},{"@type":"Question","name":" Where to find Rebate Offer Number on the Rebate Form? ","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"The Rebate Offer # is located in the Upper Middle of the Tire Rebate Redemption Form:"}},{"@type":"Question","name":" How do I use the Goodyear rebate card?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Your rebate is paid in the form of a Goodyear Visa Prepaid Card or Virtual Card. The prepaid Visa can be used like any Visa debit card. The virtual card can be used for online shopping."}},{"@type":"Question","name":" Where can I use my Goodyear rebate card?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Prepaid Card can be used everywhere Visa debit cards are accepted.Virtual Card can be used everywhere Visa debit cards are accepted online or for phone/mail orders."}}]}</script><script type="application/ld+json">{"@context":"https://schema.org/","@type":"WebSite","url":"https://www.goodyear.com","potentialAction":{"@type":"SearchAction","target":{"@type":"EntryPoint","urlTemplate":"https://www.goodyear.com/en_US/search?q={search_term_string}"},"query-i