"><div class="flex flex-col gap-2"><span class="eyebrow-md text-action-color-secondary">Support</span><h2 class="heading-md text-action-color-secondary !normal-case">Rebate Center</h2></div><div class=" last:mb-0"><p class="paragraph-md text-action-color-secondary !normal-case">Our Goodyear Rebate Center is the place to submit your rebate claim, or check the status of an already existing rebate claim. If checking status of an existing claim, please just have the details of your rebate submission handy.</p></div></div></div></div></div></div><div id="basic-text-3" class="component xxl:mb-desktop-spacing-margin-bottom-xl md:mb-desktop-spacing-padding-lg sm:mb-tablet-spacing-margin-bottom-lg mb-mobile-spacing-margin-bottom-xl component [&amp;:has(.empty-component)]:!mb-0 component !mb-mobile-spacing-margin-bottom-md sm:!mb-tablet-spacing-margin-bottom-md lg:!mb-desktop-spacing-margin-bottom-md"><div class="analytics-event-listener contents"><div class="grid grid-cols-12 w-full component [&amp;.component_&amp;]:p-0 h-full mx-auto max-w-screen-xxl px-4 sm:px-6 md:px-8 lg:px-12 xl:px-16" data-qa-id="BasicText-BasicText"><div class="col-span-12 md:col-span-8 md:col-start-3"><div id="Submit or Manage Rebates" class="w-full flex flex-col gap-4 max-w-[var(--breakpoint-container-max-width)] mx-auto text-black"><div class="flex flex-col gap-2"><h2 class="heading-md text-action-color-secondary !normal-case">Submit or Manage Rebates</h2></div><div class=" last:mb-0"><p class="paragraph-md text-action-color-secondary !normal-case">To redeem your rebate, purchase a set of four&nbsp;<a href="-us/offers/tire-rebate/index.html" type="button" data-tracking="{&quot;eventType&quot;:&quot;web.webinteraction.linkClicks&quot;,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;cta:rich-text:link&quot;,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;other&quot;,&quot;URL&quot;:&quot;https://www.goodyear.com/en-us/offers/tire-rebate&quot;,&quot;componentType&quot;:&quot;rich-text&quot;,&quot;componentName&quot;:&quot;basic-text|rich-text&quot;,&quot;componentElement&quot;:&quot;link&quot;,&quot;productListAdds&quot;:false}" class="relative cursor-pointer sm:inline-block font-type-cta custom-focus !normal-case sm:after:block after:transform-origin-center inline-block link-md text-action-text-link-primary after:content-[&quot;&quot;] after:block after:h-0.5 after:bg-current after:transition-transform after:duration-300 after:ease-out after:origin-center after:scale-x-100 hover:after:scale-x-0">rebate-eligible tires</a>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<strong class="paragraph-md text-action-color-secondary !font-bold">keep your receipt</strong>. Have your rebate offer number, name, address, and phone number ready. Goodyear&nbsp;<a href="-us/terms/online-privacy-policy/index.html" type="button" data-tracking="{&quot;eventType&quot;:&quot;web.webinteraction.linkClicks&quot;,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;cta:rich-text:link&quot;,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;other&quot;,&quot;URL&quot;:&quot;https://www.goodyear.com/en-us/terms/online-privacy-policy&quot;,&quot;componentType&quot;:&quot;rich-text&quot;,&quot;componentName&quot;:&quot;basic-text|rich-text&quot;,&quot;componentElement&quot;:&quot;link&quot;,&quot;productListAdds&quot;:false}" class="relative cursor-pointer sm:inline-block font-type-cta custom-focus !normal-case sm:after:block after:transform-origin-center inline-block link-md text-action-text-link-primary after:content-[&quot;&quot;] after:block after:h-0.5 after:bg-current after:transition-transform after:duration-300 after:ease-out after:origin-center after:scale-x-100 hover:after:scale-x-0">privacy policy</a> apply. Submit your rebate by mailing the completed form with your receipt or redeeming it online through one of our Rebate Centers. Ensure all details are accurate for a speedy and smooth process.</p></div></div></div></div></div></div><div id="grid-container-4" class="component xxl:mb-desktop-spacing-margin-bottom-xl md:mb-desktop-spacing-padding-lg sm:mb-tablet-spacing-margin-bottom-lg mb-mobile-spacing-margin-bottom-x